## Inverse-of relation

`made` is the canonical inverse of `created-by`.  When `:dt/inverse-of :mm.memory/created-by` is declared, the substrate's entailment derives `made:` from each `created-by:` assertion (and vice versa) — single-sided authoring; double-sided queryability.

